## Response Format for Audit Requests

When the user asks "what's wrong with the grading / compiler / challenges":

1. List each bug from the section above that is relevant to the scope they specified.
2. Prefix each with the challenge ID or system component it affects.
3. End with: **"No code was changed."**

Do not suggest fixes unless the user explicitly asks.
